---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: How we help
description: Group support, consultation, information, training and advocacy for tenants, residents and community groups in Sandwell.
lede: We offer support, information, training and advocacy to tenants, residents and community groups across Sandwell.
sections:
  - id: group-support
    title: Support for groups
    photo: "6351591"
    intro: Hands-on help to set up and run a tenants' and residents' association or community group properly.
    points:
      - Getting neighbours together and holding a first meeting
      - Writing a constitution and electing a committee
      - Running meetings and annual general meetings
      - Keeping records, managing money and finding funding
  - id: consultation
    title: Consultation and participation
    photo: "5220886"
    intro: We co-ordinate and support consultation so that residents' views reach Sandwell Council and housing providers, and come back as real change.
    points:
      - Explaining what's being consulted on, in plain English
      - Helping groups put together a response
      - Bringing residents and decision-makers into the same room
  - id: information
    title: Information
    photo: "5853324"
    intro: Clear information about housing, your rights and what's happening in your area, so you can make informed decisions.
    points:
      - What to expect from your landlord
      - How to raise an issue and who to contact
      - Changes to housing services that affect you
  - id: training
    title: Training
    photo: "7398084"
    intro: Training for committee members and volunteers, so you feel confident running your group and representing your area.
    points:
      - Chairing meetings and taking minutes
      - Being a treasurer
      - Understanding how housing services are run
  - id: advocacy
    title: Advocacy
    photo: "6345055"
    intro: When something isn't right, we help you set out your case clearly and take it to the people who can put it right.
    points:
      - Helping you understand the issue and your options
      - Supporting you in conversations with your landlord or the council
      - Helping groups raise issues that affect a whole street or estate
---
<div class="section">
  <div class="container with-sidebar">
    <nav class="toc" aria-labelledby="toc-title" data-toc>
      <h2 id="toc-title">On this page</h2>
      <ol>
        {% for s in sections %}<li><a href="#{{ s.id }}">{{ s.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <div>
      {% for s in sections %}
      <section class="service" id="{{ s.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ s.id }}-title">
        <div class="service__grid">
          <div class="prose">
            <p class="kicker">{{ "0" + loop.index }}</p>
            <h2 id="{{ s.id }}-title" style="margin-top:.5rem">{{ s.title }}</h2>
            <p>{{ s.intro }}</p>
            <ul>{% for p in s.points %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          </div>
          <figure class="figure">
            {% picture s.photo, "(min-width: 70em) 30vw, 100vw" %}
            <figcaption>{% credit s.photo %}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}

      <div class="panel mt-l">
        <h2>Not sure which you need?</h2>
        <p>Call us on <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or <a href="/contact/">send us a message</a> and we'll point you in the right direction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
